{"url": "https://data.stats.gov.cn/dg/website/publicrelease/web/external/new/queryIndexTreeAsync?pid=472e11f6c54f4144b233e45f3d641121&code=6", "body": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-23T22:32:45-0500", "response": {"data": [{"explain": "\n地方财政收入均为本级收入，不包括国内外债务收入。\n\n国内增值税不包括进口产品增值税。\n\n企业所得税2001年以前只包括国有及集体企业所得税，从2001年起，企业所得税还包括除国有企业和集体企业外的其他所有制企业所得税，与以前各年不可比。", "sdate": null, "_name": "地方财政收入", "treeinfo_pid": "472e11f6c54f4144b233e45f3d641121", "treeinfo_level": 5, "type": "catalog", "edate": null, "isLeaf": true, "treeinfo_globalid": "69c574ab128a44e595cc0b24502b771b.6b8e8719075f43d4bf83b261208b37b5.c4d82af16c3d4f0cb4f09d4af7d5888e.472e11f6c54f4144b233e45f3d641121.bcd3d7159957431b8f3f5b7d10bdeceb", "name": "地方财政收入", "_id": "bcd3d7159957431b8f3f5b7d10bdeceb", "publicrelease_web_catalog_id": "bcd3d7159957431b8f3f5b7d10bdeceb", "treeinfo_icon": null}, {"explain": "地方财政支出均为本级支出，2000年以前不包括国内外债务还本付息支出和利用国外借款收入安排的基本建设支出。", "sdate": null, "_name": "地方财政支出", "treeinfo_pid": "472e11f6c54f4144b233e45f3d641121", "treeinfo_level": 5, "type": "catalog", "edate": null, "isLeaf": true, "treeinfo_globalid": "69c574ab128a44e595cc0b24502b771b.6b8e8719075f43d4bf83b261208b37b5.c4d82af16c3d4f0cb4f09d4af7d5888e.472e11f6c54f4144b233e45f3d641121.f38245648b504602b851e27257f09d9b", "name": "地方财政支出", "_id": "f38245648b504602b851e27257f09d9b", "publicrelease_web_catalog_id": "f38245648b504602b851e27257f09d9b", "treeinfo_icon": null}], "success": true, "state": 20000, "message": "成功"}}